################ 3. C++ counterexample: what a WRONG flip looks like ################
--- compile the counterexample (expect: 'correct' OK, 'wrong_int' REJECTED) ---
wrong.cpp:7:50: error: invalid operands to binary expression ('int' and 'std::nullptr_t')
    7 | static int wrong_int(int v)          { return (v == nullptr) ? 1 : 0; }
      |                                                ~ ^  ~~~~~~~
